Package: symmetra
Version: 1.0.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31)
Maintainer: Symmetra <support@symmetra.dev>
Description: GPU-accelerated TypeScript compiler
 Symmetra compiles TypeScript to native CUDA machine code.
 3.1M RPS with sub-20us P99 latency.
